  "descriptionHtml": "<p> </p> <div data-mce-fragment=\"1\" class=\"jss96\"> <div data-mce-fragment=\"1\" class=\"MuiContainer-root MuiContainer-maxWidthXl\"> <div data-mce-fragment=\"1\" class=\"MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-container MuiGrid-spacing-xs-4\"> <div data-mce-fragment=\"1\" class=\"MuiGrid-root jss102 MuiGrid-item MuiGrid-grid-xs-12 MuiGrid-grid-lg-6\"> <div data-mce-fragment=\"1\" class=\"jss105\"> <p data-mce-fragment=\"1\" class=\"MuiTypography-root jss108 MuiTypography-body1\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Funny Velcro Patches bring humor and personality to your apparel and accessories, blending the high-quality feel of direct embroidery with the versatility of Velcro for easy swapping. Each patch showcases unique and amusing designs, paired with the practicality of a Velcro backing for quick attachment or detachment from any item of clothing or gear. Opt for a sleek, thin-stitched edge for a refined look, or select a sturdy Merrow border for enhanced durability. Add a touch of fun to your wardrobe with these easily interchangeable patches.</span><br></p> <p data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-weight: 600;\" class=\"MuiTypography-root jss108 MuiTypography-body1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Each patch order includes a Free roll of Thermal Tape.</span></p> <p data-mce-fragment=\"1\" class=\"MuiTypography-root jss108 MuiTypography-body1 __prematched-text\"><span>Add a Premade Patch Sample to <meta charset=\"utf-8\">Cart - $0.01 - <a href=\"https://Patch%20Krazepatches.com/cart/add?id=46978094727487&amp;quantity=1\" title=\"Add to Cart\"><strong>Add to Cart</strong></a></span></p> <p data-mce-fragment=\"1\" class=\"MuiTypography-root jss108 MuiTypography-body1 __prematched-text\"><br></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>",
